{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14418","headline":"屯田词 · 戴叔伦","name":"屯田词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春来耕田遍沙碛，老稚欣欣种禾麦。\n麦苗渐长天苦晴，土乾确确鉏不得。\n新禾未熟飞蝗至，青苗食尽余枯茎。\n捕蝗归来守空屋，囊无寸帛缾无粟。\n十月移屯来向城，官教去伐南山木。\n驱牛驾车入山去，霜重草枯牛冻死。\n艰辛历尽谁得知，望断天南泪如雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}